(text "Rev B bank board v2   10S 2.7 V 50 F (27 V 5 F, 1822 J)   per-cell TLV431 + PNP parallel clamp" (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 915606cf-7f62-4c7e-9e04-e32818d63209))
(text "Clamp Vc = Vref(1 + Ra/Rb) + Iref*Ra = 1.24 x (1 + 22.9k/20k) = 2.66 V typ  (25 C: about 2.644 - 2.689 V).  Charge 26.2 V = 2.62 V/cell average stays below every clamp." (at 15 18 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 16711658-ef48-40ff-ab54-673eb0b7f951))
(text "TLV431 SOT-23 (DBZ) pinout from TI SLVS139Z Table 4-1: 1 = REF, 2 = CATHODE, 3 = ANODE.   Rbase 100R limits the TLV431 cathode current to about 7 mA (abs max 20 mA)." (at 15 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid e9fbc015-96ed-4b3a-9479-c6c45e07d0c0))
(text "Only external interface: XT30 (S189).  Cells: 50 F 2.7 V, 18 x 40 mm radial, P 7.5 mm - hand soldered (not stocked at JLCPCB).  Fuse: 20 A mini blade (1 kA @ 32 V), soldered directly." (at 15 26 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 53bddded-a49a-4097-bfd8-c59d5163ea55))
